{% set show_internal = (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "thought" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "book" or render_mode == "equipment") %}
{% if show_internal %}
    {% if dom_actor._is_in_love %} 
        - {{dom_actor._name}} is in love with {{player.name}}
    {% else if dom_actor._is_devoted %} 
        - {{dom_actor._name}} is devoted to {{player.name}} 
    {% endif %} 
    - Orgasms are emotionally powerful and important. They always leave a powerful emotional memory. 
    {% if dom_actor._training_mind._submission >= 30 %} 
        {% if dom_actor._training_mind._submission < 60 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} is beginning to wonder if obeying sexual orders might be better than the alternative. 
        {% else if dom_actor._training_mind._submission < 90 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} thinks obeying sexual orders be better than the alternative. 
        {% else %}
            - {{dom_actor._name}} knows obeying sexual orders is be better than the alternative. 
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %} 
    {% if dom_actor._training_mind._humiliation >= 30 %} 
        {% if dom_actor._training_mind._humiliation < 60 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} is beginning to wonder if obeying a humiliating order might be better than the alternative. 
        {% else if dom_actor._training_mind._humiliation < 90 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} thinks obeying a humiliating order might be better than the alternative. 
        {% else %}
            - {{dom_actor._name}} knows obeying a humiliating order is better than the alternative. 
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %} 
    {% if dom_actor._training_mind._fear < 30 %} 
        - {{dom_actor._name}} does not fear {{dom_actor._owner}}!
    {% else if dom_actor._training_mind._fear < 60 %} 
        - {{dom_actor._name}} is a little afraid of {{dom_actor._owner}}.
    {% else if dom_actor._training_mind._fear < 90 %} 
        - {{dom_actor._name}} is afraid of {{dom_actor._owner}}.
    {% else %}
        - {{dom_actor._name}} terrified of {{dom_actor._owner}}!
    {% endif %}
    {% if dom_actor._training_mind._respect >= 30 %} 
        {% if dom_actor._training_mind._respect < 60 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} isn't certain they have worth. They are terrified that {{dom_actor._owner}} might be right. 
        {% else if dom_actor._training_mind._respect < 90 %} 
            - {{dom_actor._name}} has begun to believe that they lack inherent value, maybe only in submission to others can they find meaning and identity.
        {% else %}
            - {{dom_actor._name}} has fully internalized the idea that they are "worthless". Only through {{dom_actor._owner}} is there identity and value. 
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %} 
{% endif %}
